<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Pixel Tiers: Minecraft PvP Rankings</title>
<meta name="description" content="Live Minecraft PvP tier rankings. Every player, every gamemode, tested head-to-head.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0d0d26">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="128x128" href="/assets/crown.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/crown.png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css">
<meta property="og:title" content="Pixel Tiers: Minecraft PvP Rankings">
<meta property="og:description" content="Live Minecraft PvP tier rankings.">
<meta property="og:image" content="/assets/logo@2x.png">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Pixel Tiers">
</head>
<body>
<div class="bgfx"></div>
<header><div class="wrap bar">
  <a class="logo" href="#/home" aria-label="Pixel Tiers"><img class="logo-crown" src="/assets/crown.png" alt="" width="44" height="44"><span class="wm" aria-hidden="true"><i>P</i><i>I</i><i>X</i><i>E</i><i>L</i><b>TIERS</b></span></a>
  <nav><a id="nh" href="#/home">Home</a><a id="nt" href="#/tiers">Tiers</a><a id="ni" href="#/info">Info</a><a id="ns" href="#/store">Store</a></nav>
  <div class="acts">
    <a class="cta" data-discord target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get tested</a>
    <button class="ib" id="snd" aria-label="Toggle click sounds" title="Click sounds on/off"></button>
  </div>
</div></header>

<main class="wrap">
  <section id="home" hidden>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="live"><span class="dot"></span><span class="lt">Connecting…</span></div>
      <img class="hero-logo" src="/assets/logo@2x.png" width="280" height="235" alt="Pixel Tiers">
      <h1 class="sr-only">Pixel Tiers</h1>
      <p>Minecraft PvP rankings, tested head-to-head and updated live, all day, every day.</p>
      <div class="btns"><a class="cta big" href="#/tiers">View tiers</a><a class="cta big ghost" data-discord target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get tested</a></div>
      <div class="stats" id="stats">
        <div class="stat"><b><%= counts.players %></b><span>Players ranked</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b><%= counts.tiers %></b><span>Tiers awarded</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b><%= counts.modes %></b><span>Gamemodes</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="ih" style="text-align:center">Top of the ladder</h2>
    <div class="top3" id="top3"></div>
    <div class="feat">
      <div class="card"><div class="em"><img src="/assets/crown.png" alt="" width="32" height="32"></div><h3>Tested, not guessed</h3><p>Every tier is earned in a real fight against a tester.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="em"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" shape-rendering="crispEdges"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 1H5L3 9h3l-1 6 7-9H8z"/></svg></div><h3>Always live</h3><p>The moment a tester saves a result in Discord, it shows up here.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="em"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" shape-rendering="crispEdges"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 1l7 7-7 7-7-7z"/></svg></div><h3><%= counts.modes %> gamemodes</h3><p>From Crystal to Cart. Your tiers add up to one overall score.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="tiers" hidden>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="live"><span class="dot"></span><span class="lt">Connecting…</span></div>
      <h1>Minecraft PvP Rankings</h1>
      <p>Every player, every gamemode, tested head-to-head.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="modes" id="modes" role="tablist"></div>
    <div class="tools">
      <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search a player" aria-label="Search a player">
    </div>
    <div id="out"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="prof" hidden></section>
  <section id="info" hidden></section>
  <section id="store" hidden>
    <div class="hero"><h1>Ranks</h1><p>Support the server and stand out. Diamond and Platinum are one-time purchases. Zinc and Pixle are monthly subscriptions.</p></div>
    <div class="ranks" id="ranks"></div>
    <p class="muted members-note">Normal members: 7-day cooldown on testing and 2 custom kits. Custom kits are kits you can save your own layout for with /kiteditor. Capes show on your back in game.</p>
    <p class="sub" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px">Checkout is not open yet. The buttons below will say <b>Coming soon</b> until it is.<br>Monthly ranks will renew every month until cancelled; when a subscription ends, the rank is removed in game and in Discord.<br>Ranks are cosmetic and don't give any gameplay advantage in Minecraft.</p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="wrap">
  Made by caarhill<br>Join our Discord: <a class="dlink" href="https://discord.gg/4BXkG6nh8y" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">discord.gg/4BXkG6nh8y</a><br>Not affiliated with Mojang or Microsoft.
  <div class="staff">
    <% if (user) { %>
      Signed in as <b><%= user.username %></b><% if (user.admin) { %> · <a href="/admin">Admin</a><% } %>
      · <form method="post" action="/auth/logout" class="inline"><button class="linkbtn" type="submit">Log out</button></form>
    <% } else { %>
      <a href="/auth/discord">Staff login</a>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</footer>

<script id="boot" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(boot).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>
<script src="/assets/site.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
